## Result and nonclaim

The approved SA-1 through SA-9 private migration was applied, the planning
record set was expanded to cover the reviewed A–Z gaps, and deterministic
private checks/projections were installed. The transaction changed no runtime,
canon, application, conformance, or package file and created no successful exit
log. Two legacy root bodies remain under explicit compatibility holds because a
tracked verifier reads their exact paths/schema. The supported in-app browser
was unavailable, so desktop and narrow visual evidence remains an explicit
