three dormant seeds, 76 captured SPA routes, 202 static route strings, 102
normalized IOI handler templates, 103 Connect operations, 55 unique fixture
endpoints represented by 110 byte-paired files, 563 controls, 173 controls
whose atlas assertion is unimplemented, and 99 feature flags. These are breadth
and source facts only. Route presence, a body hash, HTTP 200/307, mock data, an
atlas label, or a shell never proves an operational journey.

